# 20. Research Management Module

The research layer should support:

* Studies
* Protocols
* Sites
* Investigators
* Study staff
* Screening
* Eligibility
* Enrollment
* Randomization where applicable
* Study visits
* CRFs
* Adverse events
* Protocol deviations
* Queries
* Monitoring
* Outcomes
* Study reports
* Data exports

